␀␀␀FATAL: fb alloc␀FATAL: ST7701 DSI bring-up␀␀RAM ALLOC FAILED␀␀␀␀# Gotek Touchscreen Interface - OMEGAWARE␀␀␀# Edit values below, then reboot.␀␀␀# Theme: 0=NAVY 1=EMBER 2=MATRIX 3=PAPER 4=SYNTH 5=GOLD␀THEME=0␀# Transfer mode: STANDALONE (USB to Gotek) or WIRELESS (ESP-NOW to dongle)␀␀MODE=STANDALONE␀# CAROUSEL: default boot view. OFF=game list, ON=cover reel, LAST=restore last view.␀␀␀␀CAROUSEL=OFF␀␀␀␀# Loop cracktro splash: 1=loop until tapped, 0=auto-dismiss after 6s␀␀␀␀LOOP=0␀␀# Boot cracktro style: 0=random each boot, or pick one:␀#   1=COPPER CLASSIC  2=STARFIELD  3=RAINBOW RASTER␀#   4=PLASMA  5=BOING BALL  6=SYNTHWAVE  7=DENISE  8=WRANGLER␀␀␀CRACKTRO=0␀␀# Font size: SMALL, NORMAL, LARGE␀␀␀FONT=NORMAL␀# Language: EN, FR, IT, ES, DE  (pull the SD and edit this line if you get stuck)␀␀␀LANG=EN␀# Screen rotation in degrees: 0 or 180 = landscape, 90 or 270 = portrait.␀␀␀# Easiest to set with the ROTATE button on the INFO screen (each tap = +90).␀␀␀␀ROTATE=0␀␀␀␀# COMPACT: OFF = cover art + list, ON = maximise the game list (cover collapses to a strip)␀COMPACT=OFF␀# BTNSTYLE: reel button style. PILL=rounded coloured buttons (default), FLAT=flat bar.␀␀BTNSTYLE=PILL␀␀␀# CAP: max wireless dongles the scan will list (default 32, up to 64)␀␀␀CAP=32␀␀# HIVEMIND: wireless FLING fan-out. ON=send to all paired MuCa dongles (classic), OFF=only the selected dongle.␀HIVEMIND=ON␀# Load/eject behaviour (all OFF = safest: select, then press the button)␀␀␀␀# TAPLOAD: ON = tapping the already-highlighted game row loads it (old double-tap)␀␀TAPLOAD=OFF␀# HOTSWAP: ON = tapping another disk while loaded swaps to it instantly␀HOTSWAP=OFF␀# FORCESWAP: ON = swap disk contents without the USB eject/re-attach cycle␀␀FORCESWAP=OFF␀␀␀# SAVES: save-game persistence when the Amiga writes to the disk.␀␀␀#   OFF       = writes live only until eject/power-off (classic behaviour)␀␀#   COPY      = writes are kept as GameName.sav.adf beside the master (recommended)␀#   OVERWRITE = writes are patched straight into the master .adf␀␀␀␀SAVES=COPY␀␀# SDSPEED: SD card clock speed.␀#   20 = safe default, works with every card.␀␀␀#   40 = ~1.7x faster reads if your card can hold it (auto-falls back to 20 if it can't mount).␀SDSPEED=20␀␀# CATEGORIES: OFF = one flat library (classic). ON = browse by category â€”␀#   any top-level folder that holds NO disk images (only subfolders) becomes a category.␀␀␀␀CATEGORIES=OFF␀␀# NESTING: OFF = categories are one level deep. ON = allow sub-categories (folders within category folders).␀␀␀␀NESTING=OFF␀# SCREENSAVER: idle slideshow. ON = show it after a few minutes idle, OFF = never.␀␀SCREENSAVER=ON␀␀# SSMODE: SLIDES = full-screen photo slideshow (default), BOUNCE = bouncing logo, MATRIX = code rain.␀␀␀SSMODE=SLIDES␀␀␀# SSFX: transition between slides - SHUFFLE (random), FADE, DISSOLVE, SLIDE, or CUT.␀␀␀␀SSFX=SHUFFLE␀␀␀␀# SSTIME: seconds each slide is shown (2-120).␀␀SSTIME=6␀␀␀␀# SSFAV: ON = also slideshow the cover art of your favourited games;␀␀␀␀#        OFF = only images you drop in the /screensaver/ folder.␀␀␀␀SSFAV=ON␀␀␀␀# LINK: dongle transport. ESPNOW = the dongle's own AP + ESP-NOW (default).␀#       HOMEWIFI = route the FLING via your home router to a Webby dongle's gotek.local.␀␀␀␀LINK=ESPNOW␀# HOME_SSID / HOME_PASS: your home WiFi (only used when LINK=HOMEWIFI).␀HOME_SSID=␀␀HOME_PASS=␀␀# DONGLE_HOME_IP: auto-filled cache of the dongle's home IP (mDNS gotek.local is primary).␀␀DONGLE_HOME_IP=␀# Wireless dongle MAC (auto-filled when you pair via INFO screen)␀␀␀# XIAO_MAC=␀/c6_network_adapter_2.12.13.bin␀C6 is v%d.%d.%d  ->  update to 2.12.13  (enables WiFi)␀␀WiFi CO-PROCESSOR UPDATE␀␀␀␀TAP the screen to update   -   wait 25s to skip␀SD read failed␀␀power-cycle & retry␀C6 OTA begin failed␀UPDATING C6 - DO NOT POWER OFF␀␀%u%%␀␀␀␀C6 OTA write failed␀rebooting...␀␀␀␀C6 updated - activating␀by Vinay Dhir␀␀␀~ PURPLE DREAMS ~␀␀␀        OMEGAWARE PRESENTS ...  DENISE  ...  BUILT BY VINAY DHIR ...  PURPLE DREAMS ...  GREETINGS FR